 everybody believed the earth was the center of the universe.

8
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:31,920
 No doubt about it.

9
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:35,060
 Yes, they thought the sun and all the planets revolved around the earth

10
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:38,040
 and had always done so, and God help anybody who didn't agree.

11
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:40,990
 Yeah, that'd be going against the teaching of the church,

12
