44
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:37,140
 It's really simple. The shorter the pendulum, the faster the frequency.

45
00:03:42,660 --> 00:03:50,330
 Look at a circle, or even better, a parabola.

46
00:03:50,330 --> 00:03:55,550
 It breaks the glass, strong as stuff.

47
00:03:55,550 --> 00:03:57,020
 My poor stomach.

48
00:03:57,020 --> 00:04:02,650
 With this pendulum, we can measure very accurately the exact pulse rate.

49
00:04:02,650 --> 00:04:06,490
 That will be helpful in determining the state of a patient's health.

50
00:04:06,490 --> 00:04:10,310
 And just who do you think you are to teach us anything about medicine?

51
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:11,880
 My name is Galileo.

52
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:13,530
 Galileo Galilei.

53
00:04:13,530 --> 00:04:16,570
 Well, Galileo Galilei, I suggest you return to class.

54
00:04:16,570 --> 00:04:18,330
 Or you've completed your studies, perhaps...

55
