 This Galileo has overstepped the bounds, the limits we have accorded him.

241
00:21:40,370 --> 00:21:42,550
 Quite so, Grand Duke, I have definitely decided.

242
00:21:43,030 --> 00:21:46,270
 We shall bring Galileo Galilei before the Holy Inquisition.

243
00:21:51,630 --> 00:21:56,080
 Quite a comfortable prison.

244
00:21:56,850 --> 00:21:58,960
 As introduction, Vincere Firenzuola.

245
00:21:59,390 --> 00:22:01,350
 I am to be Inquisitor at your trial.

246
00:22:01,350 --> 00:22:05,100
 What a strange idea, denying the transcendence of the Holy Spirit,

247
00:22:05,360 --> 00:22:09,060
 which moves the planets to the sky and replaces it with mathematical laws.

248
00:22:09,420 --> 00:22:10,600
 I'd leave that to Copernicus.

249
00:22:11,260 --> 00:22:14,580
 I only speak of Copernicus's theories as a notion, a hypothesis,

250
00:22:14,760 --> 00:22:17,360
 and isn't it time we start to question the theories of Ptolemy,

251
00:22:17,640 --> 00:22:19,120
 which are a thousand years old?

252
00:22:19,660 --> 00:22:21,360
 Shouldn't humanity progress?

253
00:22:22,270 --> 00:22:25,760
 Perhaps, my son, but always in respect to faith and holy scriptures.

254
00:22:26,180 --> 00:22:28,540
 Our flock of the faithful are mostly simple people.

255
00:22:29,080 --> 00:22:32,730
 Let them have rightful places, the sky, the sun, the earth.

256
00:22:32,730 --> 00:22:38,030
 I am a scientist, Father, and I am just revealing my views, my experiments.

257
00:22:38,230 --> 00:22:39,650
 Where is proof of what you say?

258
00:22:39,910 --> 00:22:43,690
 Galileo, Galilei, you say the earth revolves on its axis every 24 hours.

259
00:22:43,790 --> 00:22:45,810
 Wouldn't we feel it, if that were true?

260
00:22:46,370 --> 00:22:49,980
 You say that only the seas are influenced by this astounding speed.

261
00:22:50,460 --> 00:22:52,050
 But our buildings would fall.

262
00:22:52,390 --> 00:22:53,770
 Life on Earth would be impossible.

263
00:22:54,110 --> 00:22:56,370
 This acceleration is constant, progressive.

264
00:22:57,010 --> 00:22:59,460
 When we travel in a coach a thousand times slower,

265
00:22:59,950 --> 00:23:02,590
 we sense any acceleration or sudden breaking.

266
00:23:03,320 --> 00:23:04,140
 This other nothing.

267
00:23:05,700 --> 00:23:06,650
 Stop this game.

268
00:23:06,930 --> 00:23:08,470
 Eagerness to convince leads you astray.

269
00:23:09,370 --> 00:23:12,850
 For years I've observed, meditated, experimented,

270
00:23:12,850 --> 00:23:16,210
 and you contradict me simply on the basis of your belief?

271
00:23:16,810 --> 00:23:18,070
 Your arrogance is limitless.

272
00:23:18,190 --> 00:23:21,080
 Galileo, you want to order heaven at your whim.

273
00:23:21,080 --> 00:23:25,330
 Condemn your works, or it is you we shall condemn.

274
00:23:25,330 --> 00:23:27,530
 You're lucky to have friends who protect you

275
00:23:27,530 --> 00:23:31,160
 from torture and the stake.

276
00:23:31,160 --> 00:23:34,390
 Renounce, Galileo, and you will be spared torture.

277
00:23:34,390 --> 00:23:40,480
 Otherwise, yes, we'll renounce.

278
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:43,340
 God has ordered me no longer to believe

279
00:23:43,340 --> 00:23:46,910
 the earth circles the sun, and so I believe it no more.

280
00:23:46,910 --> 00:23:55,810
 I renounce, still.

281
00:23:55,810 --> 00:24:00,920
 In the 20th century, did the church at last

282
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:03,970
 decide to reinstate Galileo Galilei?

